  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like lesser angelic aspect, except you gain\nlow-light vision, darkvision 60, resistance to acid 10, resistance\nto cold 10, and DR 5/evil, and you sprout white feathered\nwings allowing you to fly at a speed of 30 feet with average\nmaneuverability. In addition, your natural weapons and any\nweapons you wield are considered good-aligned for the purpose\nof overcoming damage reduction.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions like lesser angelic aspect, except you gain\\nlow-light vision, darkvision 60, resistance to acid 10, resistance\\nto cold 10, and dr 5/evil, and you sprout white feathered\\nwings allowing you to fly at a speed of 30 feet with average\\nmaneuverability. in addition, your natural weapons and any\\nweapons you wield are considered good-aligned for the purpose\\nof overcoming damage reduction.\"",
